1
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,159
We checked the surveillance.

2
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,760
The suspect left this afternoon

3
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:53,239
from the underground parking lot.

4
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,760
Have the men search the surrounding area.

5
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,799
Catch the suspect as soon as possible.

6
00:01:58,319 --> 00:01:58,879
Yes, sir.

7
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:03,920
The higher-ups only told me

8
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,799
we were after an illegal immigrant.

9
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,599
Looking at it now, though,

10
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,000
this guy is far from simple.

11
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,360
You're right.

12
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:14,599
We're in for real trouble this time.

13
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,400
To coordinate with the Nanhai Police's

14
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,639
operation to rescue Professor Du,

15
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:27,560
Li Xiao will assign our tasks for this mission.

16
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,680
It's 5:30 a.m.

17
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,000
In approximately 20 minutes,

18
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:31,960
we will arrive in Meisuo Town.

19
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,240
There are seven thugs inside the clinic.

20
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,400
Once the operation begins,

21
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:38,280
the sniper will cover us from the opposite roof.

22
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:41,159
He Bo, Wang Keqiang, and I

23
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:43,439
will breach the second-floor terrace from the west.

24
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:46,360
Captain Li will lead the rest through the front door.

25
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,839
Hello?

26
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:43,639
Someone broke into the clinic.

27
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,560
What?

28
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,079
Move!

29
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,920
Drop your gun!

30
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:03,680
Put the gun down!

31
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,720
You might still make it out alive.

32
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:06,800
If I let him go, I'm a dead man!

33
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,279
You think you can get away now?

34
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,160
Drop the gun.

35
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,040
Put your gun down.

36
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:14,199
Okay, okay.

37
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,439
All right.

38
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,480
We're here to save lives, not take them.

39
00:05:18,639 --> 00:05:20,399
Letting him go is the only way you survive.

40
00:05:38,759 --> 00:05:39,600
Come with us, hurry!

41
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,600
No, I'm still useful to Piyazi.

42
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,759
They won't do anything to me.

43
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,240
Just go, hurry!

44
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:44,720
Thank you.

45
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,000
Let's go!

46
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,519
Water...

47
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:42,879
Water...

48
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:44,959
Water...

49
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,040
Water...

50
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:53,360
Professor Du, here, drink some water.

51
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,240
Professor Du.

52
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,240
Are you all right?

53
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,079
Who are you?

54
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,120
Don't worry.

55
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:16,560
We're a rescue team sent by Provincial Public Security.

56
00:07:16,879 --> 00:07:18,000
You're safe now.

57
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:53,439
Captain Li, Professor Du is in your hands now.

58
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,600
Stay safe on your way.

59
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,120
You're not coming with us?

60
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:58,399
I still have someone to save.

61
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:01,959
Take care.

62
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:02,720
Take care.

63
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,000
Thank you.

64
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,120
Thank you.

65
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,079
Take care.

66
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:22,360
Take care.

67
00:08:24,079 --> 00:08:24,639
Take care.

68
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,480
Take care.

69
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:13,799
If we can't capture Li Qiang in time,

70
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,600
the Chinese police undercover agents

71
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,919
inside the Tilade Cartel will be exposed.

72
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,600
The multinational joint anti-drug operation

73
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,720
won't be able to proceed smoothly.

74
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:24,000
We've already sent officers to track down the suspect.

75
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,440
Time is running out.

76
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,000
You must send more men.

77
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,559
Captain Li, how are things on your end?

78
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,919
Professor Du has been rescued.

79
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:37,720
How is Tian Xin?

80
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,679
There's no word on Li Qiang yet.

81
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,120
Rest assured,

82
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:46,039
Country M's police are scouring the area.

83
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,960
Didn't you say everything was foolproof?

84
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,679
Don't panic just yet.

85
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,759
Li Qiang has only slipped away for now.

86
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:54,279
I believe Tian Xin is also safe for now.

87
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,080
Don't worry.

88
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:58,840
Captain Li.

89
00:09:59,399 --> 00:09:59,919
Li!

90
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,440
I think you should deploy more people.

91
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:11,120
I've already sent as many men as possible.

92
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:15,879
Our department has multiple cases to handle.

93
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:18,679
The national treasure case is also

94
00:10:18,879 --> 00:10:21,600
a major international crime case.

95
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,679
The higher-ups are pushing me hard too.

96
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:26,679
This is the most

97
00:10:26,879 --> 00:10:28,279
I can do right now.

98
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:28,639
But...

99
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:35,879
Our detectives are contacting outside informants.

100
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:36,720
So far,

101
00:10:36,879 --> 00:10:38,240
they haven't found that Chinese man yet.

102
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:40,600
Don't worry, though.

103
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:42,440
Our intel network is formidable.

104
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,000
I believe within two days,

105
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:46,200
we will track down the suspect.

106
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,039
I'm afraid by then,

107
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,080
it will be too late.

108
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:57,200
Kill them!

109
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:05,919
Get in the car!

110
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:24,759
After them!

111
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:25,600
Quick, after them!

112
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:59,480
Captain Li, I'll cover you. Go, now!

113
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,799
We leave together!

114
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,440
There's no time! Fall back!

115
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:11,000
Stay safe! Don't drag out the fight!

116
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,080
Copy that!

117
00:14:14,039 --> 00:14:15,200
Let's go, move!

118
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:22,200
Ram him!

119
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:38,720
Move!

120
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,440
I'm just a burden.

121
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:46,840
I'm the one they want.

122
00:14:47,879 --> 00:14:48,639
Just go!

123
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,240
Put me down!

124
00:14:50,559 --> 00:14:51,799
Protecting you is our duty.

125
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,759
We're bringing you home.

126
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,519
Move!

127
00:15:40,799 --> 00:15:41,879
Chinese police...

128
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:50,120
For just one person,

129
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:52,840
so many officers died.

130
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,440
Is it worth it?

131
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:56,960
It is.

132
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,120
As long as we protect our fellow citizens,

133
00:16:05,639 --> 00:16:08,360
we put our lives on the line long ago.

134
00:16:15,279 --> 00:16:17,039
You really have no fear of death.

135
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:20,720
Are you really that unafraid to die?

136
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,720
Just to save me alone,

137
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,279
so many of your brothers died.

138
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:57,919
It wasn't worth it.

139
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,840
Following orders is our duty.

140
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:01,440
But...

141
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,519
that brother who stayed behind

142
00:17:03,519 --> 00:17:05,000
to cover our retreat...

143
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,359
is he...?

144
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,400
I'm sorry.

145
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,799
I'm sorry.

146
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:45,640
Reporting in, sir.

147
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:47,880
Special Action Team 719 has completed the mission.

148
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:49,519
One officer was killed in action.

149
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,079
Where is Li Xiao?

150
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,440
When we were pulling out,

151
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,480
Officer Li Xiao covered our retreat

152
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,839
and stayed behind to hold off the enemy.

153
00:19:01,079 --> 00:19:02,200
His current status is unknown.

154
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,640
What was their strength?

155
00:19:08,799 --> 00:19:09,799
Around a dozen men.

156
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:10,960
Their firepower was too heavy.

157
00:19:11,119 --> 00:19:12,680
If Li Xiao hadn't drawn them away,

158
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,079
none of us might have made it back.

159
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:20,759
Keep one squad searching along the border

160
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,799
to support Officer Li Xiao.

161
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:24,519
The rest of you, return to base and stand by.

162
00:19:25,039 --> 00:19:25,599
Yes, sir.

163
00:19:27,079 --> 00:19:27,720
Thank you.

164
00:19:35,839 --> 00:19:36,720
I need to take this call.

165
00:19:39,559 --> 00:19:40,279
Inspector Mai.

166
00:19:40,599 --> 00:19:40,960
Captain Bai.

167
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:43,440
I can't reach Officer Li right now.

168
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,759
Do you have any word on him?

169
00:19:45,039 --> 00:19:45,799
Li Xiao...

170
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,759
hasn't returned yet.

171
00:19:48,839 --> 00:19:49,839
What about the rescue operation?

172
00:19:51,319 --> 00:19:52,480
The rescue operation was a success.

173
00:19:52,759 --> 00:19:54,079
We just secured Professor Du.

174
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:57,359
But to cover their escape, Li Xiao

175
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:01,720
stayed behind to intercept Piyazi's men.

176
00:20:02,279 --> 00:20:05,000
His status is currently unknown.

177
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,079
How are things in Country M?

178
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,079
Did you catch Li Qiang?

179
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:19,519
The operation to capture Li Qiang failed.

180
00:20:20,799 --> 00:20:22,000
The Country M police

181
00:20:22,039 --> 00:20:23,559
still have no trace of Li Qiang.

182
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:26,279
I can't reach Zhuang Yan or Gedan right now either.

183
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:29,640
I'm worried their cover might be blown.

184
00:20:30,279 --> 00:20:31,799
Zhuang Yan has clashed with Li Qiang before.

185
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:32,839
If they run into each other,

186
00:20:32,839 --> 00:20:34,240
their identities will definitely be exposed.

187
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,480
Inspector Mai,

188
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,680
you have to catch Li Qiang no matter what.

189
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,240
I'm truly counting on you for this.

190
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:40,240
I'm sorry, Captain Bai.

191
00:20:40,279 --> 00:20:41,480
As for the arrest operation,

192
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,119
it's in the hands of the Country M police.

193
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:45,039
I have zero control over it.

194
00:20:45,359 --> 00:20:46,480
All I can do now

195
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:48,079
is have Jin Qiang and Tony

196
00:20:48,279 --> 00:20:49,680
tail Qin Mu and Jiang Liye.

197
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,839
Maybe through them,

198
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:53,559
we can get a lead on Li Qiang.

199
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:55,000
Right now,

200
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:57,720
Country M police have launched a citywide manhunt.

201
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:58,960
Zhuang Yan and Gedan

202
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,680
have already crossed the border with Ma Jingrong.

203
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,279
The clearance paperwork—

204
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:21,279
I didn't expect you to get it done so quickly.

205
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,279
I just happened to know the right people.

206
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:28,319
But it cost quite a bit this time.

207
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:29,680
As for Mr. Tilade,

208
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:30,640
will he be unhappy about it?

209
00:21:33,039 --> 00:21:34,400
He focuses on the big picture.

210
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:35,680
I doubt he will.

211
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:40,519
You secured the clearance permits this time,

212
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:41,960
and as for the buyers,

213
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,559
you brought them over from back home too.

214
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,880
I'm sure once you meet Mr. Tilade,

215
00:21:46,319 --> 00:21:48,000
he'll think very highly of you.

216
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:53,480
From now on, at Tilade's side,

217
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:55,240
you alone will be more than enough.

218
00:21:58,119 --> 00:21:58,839
Brother Ma,

219
00:21:59,039 --> 00:22:00,559
I can tell what you're getting at.

220
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:02,519
Do you really think I, Xiao Zhuang,

221
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:04,160
am the kind of guy who burns bridges?

222
00:22:05,759 --> 00:22:07,599
Of course not. Just kidding.

223
00:22:10,119 --> 00:22:11,759
I saved your life in prison.

224
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,480
I know you'd never forget that.

225
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:25,119
I still remember Brother Ma saying

226
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:26,839
that once you made big money,

227
00:22:27,039 --> 00:22:28,200
you'd take Xiaobai and me abroad.

228
00:22:28,359 --> 00:22:29,359
You haven't forgotten, have you?

229
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:32,200
We're ride-or-die brothers.

230
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:35,680
We share the good times and the bad.

231
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:36,880
Good.

232
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,200
Then make enough money soon.

233
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:43,039
All this fighting and killing...

234
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,559
it needs to come to an end.

235
00:22:45,759 --> 00:22:46,640
Don't worry, sister-in-law.

236
00:22:47,519 --> 00:22:49,880
Now that we have this connection with Shen Xinru,

237
00:22:50,119 --> 00:22:51,519
I'm sure in less than three years,

238
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:54,200
you two can buy luxury homes abroad,

239
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,400
buy yachts,

240
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,079
and even get private jets.

241
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:58,640
It's definitely within reach.

242
00:23:05,079 --> 00:23:07,160
I wonder how Siqi is doing right now.

243
00:23:09,039 --> 00:23:10,519
No wonder you've been so restless

244
00:23:10,519 --> 00:23:11,759
ever since you got up this morning.

245
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,359
Missing your wife, are you?

246
00:23:14,759 --> 00:23:15,559
Not really.

247
00:23:16,359 --> 00:23:17,519
You know your sister-in-law.

248
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:18,880
She's very independent

249
00:23:19,359 --> 00:23:20,680
and can take good care of herself.

250
00:23:22,559 --> 00:23:25,000
I'm mainly worried about my brother Li Qiang.

251
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,599
I wonder if he's back yet.

252
00:23:33,599 --> 00:23:34,319
He will be.

253
00:23:40,079 --> 00:23:40,519
Boss.

254
00:23:41,119 --> 00:23:42,319
The boys searched everywhere,

255
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,559
but still no sign of Li Qiang.

256
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:51,640
Mr. Ma specifically told me before leaving

257
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,839
to take good care of his brother.

258
00:23:55,039 --> 00:23:56,359
Now he's gone missing.

259
00:23:57,559 --> 00:23:58,559
When Mr. Ma gets back,

260
00:23:59,559 --> 00:24:01,799
I really won't know how to answer to him.

261
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:08,519
I heard

262
00:24:08,759 --> 00:24:10,720
police raided the Four Seasons two days ago.

263
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:12,880
Could it be that Mr. Ma's brother

264
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,680
got spooked and went into hiding?

265
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,680
He has my address

266
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,119
and my phone number.

267
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:24,160
If he was afraid of the cops looking for him,

268
00:24:24,839 --> 00:24:27,039
why didn't he reach out to me earlier?

269
00:24:30,359 --> 00:24:31,000
Mr. Qin.

270
00:24:31,799 --> 00:24:32,319
Qiang.

271
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,519
I just got word from Zhuang.

272
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:36,759
He said he and Mr. Ma are returning to Country M this afternoon.

273
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,279
I've already told Mr. Jiang.

274
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:41,599
Mr. Jiang wants us early tomorrow morning

275
00:24:41,799 --> 00:24:43,279
to go see Mr. Tilade.

276
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:51,160
This is Li Qiang. Put your boss on.

277
00:24:51,559 --> 00:24:52,119
Hold on.

278
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,160
It's Li Qiang.

279
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,039
Where are you right now?

280
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:00,279
You don't need to know where I am.

281
00:25:00,559 --> 00:25:02,160
I don't want the cops tracking me down again.

282
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,759
What are you getting at?

283
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:06,119
When the police hit the Four Seasons,

284
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:07,960
their target was me.

285
00:25:09,279 --> 00:25:10,599
And the only ones who knew I was staying there

286
00:25:10,759 --> 00:25:12,240
were you and your men.

287
00:25:20,039 --> 00:25:21,079
So what do you plan to do?

288
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,880
The only person I can trust right now

289
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:23,839
is my big brother.

290
00:25:24,119 --> 00:25:25,359
When can I see him?

291
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:28,400
Look, Mr. Ma is returning to Country M this afternoon.

292
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:29,880
Come to my place,

293
00:25:30,119 --> 00:25:31,279
and I guarantee you'll see him.

294
00:25:32,039 --> 00:25:33,319
Forget coming to your place.

295
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:35,079
I can't fully trust you yet.

296
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:36,799
It's too risky.

297
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:39,079
Sounds like there's a misunderstanding between us.

298
00:25:39,279 --> 00:25:41,240
How about this: you name the time and place.

299
00:25:41,359 --> 00:25:42,200
As soon as Mr. Ma arrives,

300
00:25:42,359 --> 00:25:43,599
I'll bring him to meet you.

301
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:44,839
When the time comes,

302
00:25:45,039 --> 00:25:46,640
I'll explain everything in person.

303
00:25:48,559 --> 00:25:48,960
Fine.

304
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:49,960
Good.

305
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:20,799
Hello, this is Jinma Inn.

306
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:21,799
Hello.

307
00:26:22,039 --> 00:26:22,680
Hello.

308
00:26:25,559 --> 00:26:26,279
Hello.

309
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:34,279
Boss, what's going on?

310
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:38,000
Li Qiang is at Jinma Inn right now.

311
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,079
He says only when Mr. Ma arrives

312
00:26:41,039 --> 00:26:42,160
will he come out to meet us.

313
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:47,480
Looks like the police raid the night before last

314
00:26:48,279 --> 00:26:49,559
really spooked him.

315
00:26:51,799 --> 00:26:54,240
Li Qiang said the night before last,

316
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:56,880
the police didn't raid the Four Seasons for a routine check,

317
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,799
but specifically to catch him.

318
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:04,160
Li Qiang is just an illegal immigrant.

319
00:27:05,079 --> 00:27:07,480
The police wouldn't make such a fuss

320
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,599
over someone like him.

321
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:14,680
The question is,

322
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,839
how did the police know

323
00:27:17,839 --> 00:27:20,119
Li Qiang was staying at the Four Seasons?

324
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:26,000
It's probably a coincidence.

325
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:30,400
I think Li Qiang might just be overly cautious.

326
00:27:34,039 --> 00:27:35,960
Li Qiang just arrived in Country M.

327
00:27:36,519 --> 00:27:39,880
Country M's police wouldn't be interested in him.

328
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,440
Xiao'an, Tony.

329
00:27:43,319 --> 00:27:45,079
You two come with me to see Mr. Ma.

330
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:48,240
You stay here.

331
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,240
If Li Qiang calls again,

332
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:51,079
tell him

333
00:27:51,079 --> 00:27:53,119
Mr. Ma will definitely see him this afternoon.

334
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,319
Just tell him to stay put.

335
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:54,960
Got it.

336
00:27:55,799 --> 00:27:56,279
Let's go.

337
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:31,759
You said that once we reached Country M,

338
00:28:31,759 --> 00:28:32,960
everything would be different.

339
00:28:34,559 --> 00:28:35,920
But look at you now.

340
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:37,000
Aren't you still on the run?

341
00:28:37,759 --> 00:28:39,920
That's only because I haven't seen my brother yet.

342
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,279
How do you know

343
00:28:43,839 --> 00:28:45,319
that someone else betrayed you?

344
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,440
What if your brother's the one giving up on you?

345
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,839
Whatever you say or do,

346
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:54,039
I can put up with it.

347
00:28:54,279 --> 00:28:55,200
But I'm warning you,

348
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,519
don't say a single bad word about my brother!

349
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:05,079
The kind of people you deal with

350
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:07,200
determines the kind of life you lead.

351
00:29:07,599 --> 00:29:09,480
Did you really think that street loyalty of yours

352
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:10,599
could actually save you?

353
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,720
Even if your brother didn't betray you,

354
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:15,200
he still led you down a path of no return.

355
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:17,279
Whether back home or right here,

356
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:19,240
your life won't be any different.

357
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,960
I chose this path myself,

358
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,480
and I'm seeing it through.

359
00:29:23,119 --> 00:29:23,920
Don't you forget,

360
00:29:25,119 --> 00:29:26,519
right now, your life

361
00:29:28,039 --> 00:29:29,920
is in my hands.

362
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:50,519
I know I've put you through so much,

363
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:54,839
but like I said,

364
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,400
once we meet my brother,

365
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,440
everything will be fine.

366
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:35,279
Hello.

367
00:30:35,359 --> 00:30:37,599
It's me. Li Qiang is at Jinma Inn right now.

368
00:30:38,119 --> 00:30:39,839
He's meeting Ma Jingrong this afternoon.

369
00:30:40,039 --> 00:30:40,759
Understood.

370
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,559
I'll notify Sergeant Rosen right away.

371
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:44,079
Qin Mu has taken his men

372
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,319
to meet Ma Jingrong.

373
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:47,440
I think Li Qiang could

374
00:30:47,599 --> 00:30:48,920
leave the inn to meet them at any moment.

375
00:30:49,119 --> 00:30:50,880
I'm heading over now. Get there as soon as you can.

376
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,920
No, you could blow your cover doing that.

377
00:30:54,279 --> 00:30:55,400
There's no time to worry about that.

378
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,640
What matters most right now

379
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,599
is protecting the undercover officer's identity.

380
00:30:59,160 --> 00:30:59,640
No.

381
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:05,079
Listen, you must be careful.

382
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,200
Don't worry.

383
00:32:58,559 --> 00:32:59,720
Li Qiang told me

384
00:33:00,319 --> 00:33:01,759
that one of my own brothers

385
00:33:02,039 --> 00:33:03,759
leaked his stay at the Four Seasons Hotel

386
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:04,839
to the police.

387
00:33:05,079 --> 00:33:06,599
At first, I didn't quite believe it.

388
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:11,720
But I never imagined

389
00:33:13,599 --> 00:33:14,880
it would turn out to be you.

390
00:33:15,799 --> 00:33:16,480
And what's more,

391
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,039
you were so reckless.

392
00:33:24,839 --> 00:33:25,839
Haven't I treated you well?

393
00:33:26,359 --> 00:33:28,680
All these years, I've always

394
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:30,079
treated you like my own brother.

395
00:33:32,079 --> 00:33:32,960
You've treated me well.

396
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,359
But I'm a cop.

397
00:33:40,240 --> 00:33:41,720
I know you won't say a word.

398
00:33:42,359 --> 00:33:45,319
Still, I want to give you one last chance.

399
00:33:47,799 --> 00:33:49,640
Stick with me from today on,

400
00:33:50,799 --> 00:33:52,359
and I'll let bygones be bygones.

401
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,160
Remember this:

402
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:03,799
I'm a cop,

403
00:34:05,079 --> 00:34:06,000
and you're a criminal.

404
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,880
Nothing can change that fact.

405
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:11,159
Unless you kill me.

406
00:36:08,039 --> 00:36:08,800
Jin Qiang!

407
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,559
Jin Qiang!

408
00:36:10,519 --> 00:36:10,880
Jin Qiang!

409
00:36:11,599 --> 00:36:12,320
Jin Qiang!

410
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,599
What do we do now?

411
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,440
There's nothing we can do.

412
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:03,159
Jin Qiang has been working with us

413
00:37:03,239 --> 00:37:04,440
for a long time now.

414
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:06,000
He must have gathered

415
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:07,159
plenty of evidence against us.

416
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:09,480
If the police sent him to watch us,

417
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:11,559
why are we still untouched?

418
00:37:12,079 --> 00:37:13,360
Why would the police obsess over

419
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:15,079
Li Qiang, who just crossed the border?

420
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:16,960
Even now,

421
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:17,920
I still can't make sense of it.

422
00:37:19,119 --> 00:37:20,360
But either way,

423
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,199
now that Lao Ma

424
00:37:21,199 --> 00:37:23,119
opened up channels in mainland China,

425
00:37:23,639 --> 00:37:24,400
our business

426
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:26,679
will soon expand into the mainland.

427
00:37:28,239 --> 00:37:28,800
Boss,

428
00:37:29,239 --> 00:37:32,440
do you think there are more undercover cops around us

429
00:37:33,199 --> 00:37:34,760
than just Jin Qiang?

430
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:43,440
Jin Qiang risked being exposed

431
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:45,480
just to beat Qin Mu

432
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,519
to finding Li Qiang.

433
00:37:46,599 --> 00:37:47,599
If I'm not mistaken,

434
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:49,840
for the international operation

435
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:50,760
you're currently running,

436
00:37:51,159 --> 00:37:52,440
Li Qiang is like a ticking time bomb.

437
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:54,039
You must be worried that

438
00:37:54,239 --> 00:37:56,000
once that bomb goes off,

439
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,000
your entire operation will be ruined.

440
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:02,480
I am indeed worried about the operation,

441
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:04,199
but right now, what worries me most

442
00:38:04,199 --> 00:38:05,239
is the safety of two people.

443
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,000
Can't you just call off the operation?

444
00:38:30,559 --> 00:38:32,119
The hail of bullets in Jiangyang

445
00:38:32,719 --> 00:38:34,119
makes being back here

446
00:38:34,920 --> 00:38:36,440
feel a lot safer by comparison.

447
00:38:39,039 --> 00:38:41,679
We teamed up with Old Qin to take out Xiang Nan this time.

448
00:38:43,039 --> 00:38:45,239
Could that bring us bigger trouble abroad?

449
00:38:48,199 --> 00:38:50,000
Trouble can strike anytime.

450
00:38:51,199 --> 00:38:54,079
Right now, the boss backing us

451
00:38:54,079 --> 00:38:55,679
is Mr. Tilade.

452
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:58,880
With Mr. Tilade's standing

453
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:00,239
within the syndicate,

454
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:01,960
I believe Piyazi

455
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,880
won't mess with us so easily.

456
00:39:06,320 --> 00:39:06,760
Wait,

457
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:10,519
how do you know Tilade will protect us?

458
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,519
After all, we're not his own men.

459
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:16,719
Shared interests.

460
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,360
Tilade needs us.

461
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:23,840
He and Piyazi are rivals.

462
00:39:24,079 --> 00:39:26,400
Over the mainland Chinese market,

463
00:39:26,559 --> 00:39:28,559
they're at each other's throats.

464
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:30,320
On Tilade's behalf,

465
00:39:30,440 --> 00:39:32,239
we took out someone from the rival camp.

466
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,840
He should be pleased with that.

467
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:37,599
Xiao Zhuang,

468
00:39:38,679 --> 00:39:41,519
The timing, location, and people are all in our favor.

469
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:44,239
It's the perfect time to make our mark.

470
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:08,199
You're finally back.

471
00:40:08,199 --> 00:40:10,000
Mr. Jiang even sent men to check several times.

472
00:40:10,239 --> 00:40:11,719
Luckily, you handled

473
00:40:11,719 --> 00:40:13,199
what Tilade asked of you.

474
00:40:13,960 --> 00:40:16,480
With Xiao Zhuang around, nothing's an issue.

475
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:20,159
From the moment I first saw you,

476
00:40:20,159 --> 00:40:21,280
my gut told me

477
00:40:22,639 --> 00:40:23,559
you're no ordinary man.

478
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:24,880
And your wife as well.

479
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:26,920
Neither of you is to be underestimated.

480
00:40:29,519 --> 00:40:30,440
You flatter us, Mr. Qin.

481
00:40:30,719 --> 00:40:32,079
Getting things settled this time

482
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:33,480
was all thanks to Brother Ma.

483
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:35,519
Let's get in the car first.

484
00:40:36,159 --> 00:40:37,679
Your brother Li Qiang is waiting.

485
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:40,159
Li Qiang is with you?

486
00:40:40,559 --> 00:40:42,119
Why didn't you tell me on the phone?

487
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:45,719
We already met up with Li Qiang two days ago.

488
00:40:45,880 --> 00:40:48,000
It's just that a few complications came up.

489
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:49,400
Never mind that, let's talk in the car.

490
00:40:49,559 --> 00:40:50,559
I'll explain on the way.

491
00:40:50,920 --> 00:40:52,199
I'll drive. We'll take your car.

492
00:40:52,320 --> 00:40:52,599
All right.

493
00:40:52,639 --> 00:40:54,079
You two follow my car.

494
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,960
Sir, your coffee.

495
00:41:30,639 --> 00:41:33,239
Miss, your lemon tea.

496
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:53,159
Don't spill the drinks.

497
00:42:17,360 --> 00:42:18,199
That means

498
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:22,119
as soon as Li Qiang arrived, the local police

499
00:42:22,119 --> 00:42:23,039
already had their eyes on him.

500
00:42:24,679 --> 00:42:25,800
That seems to be the case.

501
00:42:26,039 --> 00:42:27,960
The info on Li Qiang earlier

502
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,360
was leaked to the police by Jin Qiang.

503
00:42:30,480 --> 00:42:31,280
It had no direct connection to us,

504
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:33,239
or to Li Qiang.

505
00:42:34,079 --> 00:42:34,719
Old Ma,

506
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:38,440
could the police's real target

507
00:42:39,159 --> 00:42:40,119
actually be you?

508
00:42:44,760 --> 00:42:46,079
Probably not.

509
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:48,280
If it were me,

510
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:49,880
I wouldn't be sitting here.

511
00:42:53,960 --> 00:42:55,320
Did Li Qiang ever tell you

512
00:42:55,480 --> 00:42:57,840
who that woman by his side really is?

513
00:43:00,280 --> 00:43:02,639
Li Qiang seemed very reluctant to mention her.

514
00:43:03,079 --> 00:43:04,320
And as for that woman,

515
00:43:05,280 --> 00:43:06,519
my gut tells me

516
00:43:07,079 --> 00:43:08,840
she was forced to come to Country M.
